This code first constructs the graph based on the given topology and flows. It then calculates the Hypercycle and the WCD for each flow. Finally, it calculates the confidence score based on the WCD values and prints the results in JSON format.

The `networkx` library is used to construct the graph, and the `networktime` library is used to calculate the time difference between the start and end of each edge. The `json` library is used to print the results in JSON format.

The `cqf_parameters` dictionary defines the parameters used for the CQF, including the bandwidth, propagation delay, switching delay, time synchronization error, switch type, cycle duration, and number of cycles.

The `hypercycle` variable is an instance of the `HypercycleGraph` class from the `networkx` library, which represents the Hypercycle.

The `calculate_hypercycle` method calculates the Hypercycle by iterating over all edges in the graph and adding them to the Hypercycle.

The `WCD_us` attribute of each flow is calculated by summing up the time difference between the start and end of each edge in the Hypercycle. The confidence score is calculated by dividing 1 by the WCD value for each flow, and then summing up the confidence scores.
